Package: hermes-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: aarch64
Maintainer: Termux-native port (unofficial; upstream: Nous Research, MIT)
Description: Hermes Agent CLI for Termux (Termux-native port)
 Self-improving AI agent: CLI, TUI, and messaging gateway.
 This is a Termux-native .deb port of NousResearch/hermes-agent.
 It uses Termux's python/nodejs; no vendored runtimes.
Depends: python (>= 3.14), python-pillow, nodejs, bash, libffi, libheif, openssl
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
